<h2>How to Set Up a Compact Seated Elliptical</h2>
<ol>
<li><strong>Measure clearance.</strong> Sit at your desk and check that your knees clear the underside at the top of the stride. Our <a href="/tools/desk-clearance-checker/">desk clearance checker</a> helps.</li>
<li><strong>Add a mat.</strong> A [[amazon:cubii-mat|non-slip mat]] stops sliding and dampens vibration.</li>
<li><strong>Stop chair drift.</strong> Use a chair without wheels or add [[amazon:caster-cups|caster cups]].</li>
<li><strong>Sit at the right distance.</strong> Keep a slight bend in your knee at full extension.</li>
<li><strong>Start light.</strong> Use low resistance while typing and save higher settings for calls or reading.</li>
</ol>
<p>More tips are in our guide on <a href="/how-to-use-under-desk-elliptical/">how to use an under desk elliptical</a>.</p>

